# bullframe.css

- Native CSS + PostCSS only. No Sass.
- Keep seven builds. Do not add `bullframe-modern.css`.
- Branch / PR into `v6` for v6 work. Do not touch `main` unless asked.
- Builds: Browserslist `defaults`. Gate progressive enhancements with `@supports`.
- Docs deploy secrets (names only): `FTP_HOST`, `FTP_USERNAME_PRODUCTION`, `FTP_PASSWORD_PRODUCTION`. Never invent values.
- No agent / Cursor attribution in commits or PRs.
- Prefer short CSS banners; one third-party attribution where needed.
- Before push: `npm run lint`, `npm run build`; add docs/e2e when those surfaces change.
